Hotspot Admission Source (Reseller\Tests\Unit\Wp4\HotspotAdmissionSource)
 ✔ The slots run only for hotspot after h 1 a and never for pppoe
 ✔ Order identity age slots claim verifier late claim class
 ✔ Claim v 2 is a precheck and one conditional update without a subquery
 ✔ Strict mode only two releases and never of a pending slot by time or snmp
 ✔ Every refusal is filtered and no radacct write or delete
 ✔ Accounting is token bound and never revives or deletes
 ✔ The stock simultaneous use check is skipped for hotspot only
 ✔ The verifier module and program are fail closed and read only
 ✔ Schema is additive and the only sql files are read only except the migration

