Radius Source Guard (Reseller\Tests\Unit\Wp4\RadiusSourceGuard)
 ✔ Virtual server requires message authenticator on access request only
 ✔ Accounting history is never deleted or rewritten
 ✔ No shell in any radius path
 ✔ No interpolated sql in the endpoint and radius classes
