 ✔ The policy is the gate tested policy at the start of post auth
 ✔ Discriminator key and decision are fail closed
 ✔ Exec module has no shell no environment and a bounded timeout
 ✔ Guard program keeps the gate tested logic
 ✔ Stale sessions are never zapped and start scripts use the permanent files

